  "expert_note": "Snapshot of the client KEYS_SETTINGS / KEYS_LOCAL_SETTINGS / KEYS_DISPLAY_SETTINGS / KEYS_BUILDIN_SETTINGS arrays. Advanced maps accept string keys verbatim; unknown keys are not guaranteed to have a consumer. Local/display/builtin customization is not heartbeat policy delivery. conn-type accepts incoming or outgoing. Logos/icons require assets in your own client source build. Preset permanent-password storage is deliberately not exposed by this catalog."
